    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a random person trapped in an empty concrete room under the watchful eye of a camera. The only way out is to risk pressing the forbidden button, after which more buttons appear. Each press brings you closer to the exit or to your demise. After each death, you return as a new person, but always in the same cold room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The room contains dozens of buttons. Each one triggers an unpredictable event: gas, water, darkness, or unexpected objects. The player marks safe and deadly buttons to find the path to salvation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/5d91251b608900c19eab5e8452ea6e14.poster.avif?t=1755191699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/5d91251b608900c19eab5e8452ea6e14.webm?t=1755191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/5d91251b608900c19eab5e8452ea6e14.mp4?t=1755191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The room reacts to your actions:</strong> flooding, gas, deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and puzzles</strong>: physical objects, hidden passages, riddles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmosphere of tension and total control.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/b04f578e61c0908ca68ff740122a70cf.poster.avif?t=1755191699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/b04f578e61c0908ca68ff740122a70cf.webm?t=1755191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/b04f578e61c0908ca68ff740122a70cf.mp4?t=1755191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ending Variations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is not guaranteed. The game features over 10 unique ways to die: drowning, burning, suffocation, and more. Each death is added to a board your personal collection of failures. After each defeat, you return as a new person, but with the same terrifying mysteries and your previous experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/9559c30208012d0b0d79d29ef9d0cfc6.poster.avif?t=1755191699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/9559c30208012d0b0d79d29ef9d0cfc6.webm?t=1755191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823800/extras/9559c30208012d0b0d79d29ef9d0cfc6.mp4?t=1755191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
